{"id":1742,"date":"2026-03-07T09:04:25","date_gmt":"2026-03-07T09:04:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/isvlsi.santechglobalusa.com\/?page_id=1742"},"modified":"2026-03-07T13:36:39","modified_gmt":"2026-03-07T13:36:39","slug":"venue","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/isvlsi.santechglobalusa.com\/venue\/","title":{"rendered":"Venue"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Venue city: ITC Sonar, Kolkata, India<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">The City of Joy \u2013 Kolkata<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"justify wp-block-paragraph\">Kolkata, the cultural capital of India, is a vibrant metropolis that beautifully blends rich heritage with modern development. Located in the eastern part of the country, the city is known for its historic architecture, intellectual traditions, literature, art, and warm hospitality. Kolkata has long been a center for education, science, and innovation, hosting several renowned universities, research institutions, and technology organizations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"justify wp-block-paragraph\">Visitors to the city can experience iconic landmarks, diverse cuisine, and a lively cultural atmosphere. With excellent connectivity through Netaji Subhas Chandra Bose International Airport and a well-developed urban infrastructure, Kolkata provides an ideal setting for international conferences, academic exchange, and collaborative research. The city\u2019s unique charm and dynamic academic ecosystem make it a welcoming destination for participants from around the world.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<style>\n        \n         \n        .map-container{\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 500px;\n        }\n        iframe{\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n